                    <h4 className="text-xs font-bold text-stone-850">
                      {googleToken ? '? Google Gmail ?喲??賢歇撠梁?' : '? Google Gmail ?喲??賣?'}
                    </h4>
                    <p className="text-[11px] text-stone-500">
                      {googleToken 
                        ? `蝟餌絞撠誑?函?蝞∠??隞嗅董?嗥??瑕?撘` 
                        : '?祉頂蝯望?湧? Google Auth 隞交?恣?靽∠拳?潮縑隞塚?隢?摰??????'}
                    </p>
